---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { contact } from "../data/links";
---

<Base title="Our approach — Roomly">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">The thinking behind Roomly</p>
    <h1>
      Built around rooms.
      <br />
      Made for people.
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A property is a building. A home is everything that happens inside it.
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Keep the connected things connected.</h2>
    <p>
      The room, the people living in it, the rent schedule and the condition
      report belong together. Roomly keeps that context in one place, so a small
      team can pick up where someone else left off.
    </p>
    <h2>Make the everyday feel lighter.</h2>
    <p>
      Clear records. Familiar words. A useful overview, followed by the detail
      when you need it. Roomly gives the routine work of looking after a
      property a calmer place to happen.
    </p>
    <h2>Come on in.</h2>
    <p>
      Tell us a little about the homes you manage and what you’d like to make
      easier.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href={contact}>
      Request access <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
    <p>
      Prefer email?{" "}
      <a href="mailto:joshuakhalili20@gmail.com">joshuakhalili20@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
